1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Karin Thoresdatter Pytting [Parents] was born in Stola på Kållandsøy i Veneren. She died in Stola på Kållandsøy i Veneren. She married Clas Ribbing.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karin ble gift med Clas Ribbing til Stola. Kilder: N.S.T bd. XXXII hft. II s.109.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT M i Nils Classon Ribbing.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Nils Classon Ribbing [Parents].
2 CONT
2 CONT He had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT F i Agnete Nielsdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Hansson.Anders married Agnete Nielsdatter in 1529.
