2 CONT '''The Swedish Diplomatarium's main catalog of medieval letters'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1479 without day''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Byting Olofsson sells with his mother Humfrid Jonsdotter's consent land in Hög (Sunnersbergs sn, Kållands hd).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Post-medieval regest/notice:  Kålland district court AIa:14 (1697-1700) (under 26 January 1698), GLA, Literature and commentary For Humfrid and son Byting, see SoH 1958, p. 10, and cf. SDHK no. 30430 , which lette
2 CONC r this (partially) supplemented/corrected dating is based on.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Stola&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=10&postid=sdhk_30430&tab=post SDHK-nr: 30430]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Swedish Diplomatarium's main catalog of medieval letters'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Date: 1478 July 25, Place of issue: Stole'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Humfridh" Jonsdotter, Byting's widow in "Stordhom" (Stola i Strö sn, Kållands hd, Västergötland), with the consent of her son Byting, gives a part in a meadow at Aspenäs ödetorp to Otterstad's rectory. The issuer seals together wi
2 CONC th Sten, parish priest in Sunnersberg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Original: Or. perg. RA 0101 images. Post-medieval regest/notice: Hellm. Misc. 64:13 (reg.) Literature and commentary. Cf. SDHK no. 44755. Ang. Stola, see I. Lundahl, Medieval Västergötland (Uppsala 1961) p. 144.
