1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From http://www.cosoft.org/mowat/balquholly.html: '''Patrick Mowat, of Balquholly'''. Heir of his father 30 March 1564 in Freswick and Howpistell in Caithness.16 Died before June 1603. He was still living 1 Februar
2 CONC y 1598-99 when his son is styled ‘apparent of Balquholly’.11 Married before 9 October 1559 Christine Ogilvy, daughter of Walter Ogilvy of Boyne.20
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by Christine Ogilvy:
2 CONT # Magnus, see X.
2 CONT # James of Smiddyseat, see XI.
2 CONT # Christian Mowat. Married (contract 13 March 1591) James Gardin, son of Alexander Gardin of Blackford, and had issue.
2 CONT # Isobel Mowat. Died 19 May 1601. Married William Bruce of Stanstill.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Mowat. Married George Crawford of Annochie.
2 CONT # Jean Mowat. Married Alexander Calder of Asloun.
