1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 23272. Tore Torkellson Koll, son of Torkell Jonsson Koll and Unknown, was born about 1425 in Norway 540 and died in 1495 in Stavanger, Rogaland, Norway 540 541 aged about 70. Other names for Tore were Tore Torkelso
2 CONC n,541 Tore Tormodson,541 Tor Torkelson Koll,544 Tore Torkelson Koll,541 Tore Torkildson Koll,541 Tore Tormodson Koll,541 Tore Torkelson, and541 Tore Tormodson.541 
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: He may have been a lagmann (in Stavanger) up to 1491.
2 CONT
2 CONT Noted events in his life were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT • Occupation: Lagmann from 1458 to 1490. 
2 CONT
2 CONT • Alt. Death: 1491. 545 
2 CONT
2 CONT Tore married. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His children were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT              i.  Nfn Toresdatter Koll was born on an unknown date in Norway and died on an unknown date in Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT             ii.  Karen Toresdatter Kold was born from about 1460 to 1467 in Norway 546 and died on an unknown date in Norway. Other names for Karen were Karen Koll, and525 Karen Nessa.525 
2 CONT
2 CONT 11636      iii.  Jakob Torson Koll (born from 1520 to 1530 in Indre Nessa, Nedstrand, Tysvær
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Tore Torkjellsen Koll, sønn av Torkjell Torkjellsen Koll og Ukjent, ble født ca 1420 og døde etter 1489. Et annet navn for Tore var Torkildsen. Han var Lagrettemann. Tore giftet seg med Ukjent. Hans barn var: i. Karen Koll. Karen 
2 CONC giftet seg med Trond Sigurdsen Seim. Ekteskapsstatus: usikkert. Karen giftet seg deretter med Fartegn Matssen Ænes. ii. Eivind Toresen Koll
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Tore Torkellsson KOLD
2 CONT
2 CONT 1421 - 1491
2 CONT
2 CONT RESIDENCE: 15 Jan 1462, Nevnt som Lagmann i Stavanger (i Arnegård) OCCUPATION: Utnevnt av Christian I til ny Lagmann i Stavanger 19 Aug 1458 BIRTH: 1421, Nessa, Nedstrand, Ryfylke, RO (usikre foreldre) BAPTISM: (adelig) ['Stjerne 
2 CONC med en rose under'] DEATH: 1491, (1495 ?) Stavanger
2 CONT --------------------
