2 CONT iii Else Christensdtr. Trane b. 1548, Viborg, Danmark, m.Mogens Jensen, b. Æ18.  Else died AFT 1600, Stavanger, Norge. Æ18.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv Peder Christensen b. 1550.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Gift flere ganger: 4?
2 CONT * Maren Nielsdatter;  
2 CONT * Elsie Christensdatter; død etter 1600 i Stavanger 
2 CONT * Kirsten Pallesdatter Splid Fasti  
2 CONT * Margrethe Pedersdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn sammen med Kirsten Pallesdtr:
2 CONT * Christen Christensson b. 1528.
2 CONT * Palle Christensen b. 1537.
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn:
2 CONT * Christen Christensen Thrane, d. e.; 
2 CONT * Palle Christensen Trane; 
2 CONT * Else Christensdatter Thrane; 
2 CONT * Michel Christensen Lind; 
2 CONT * Maren Margrete Christensdatter Lind og 2 andre 
2 CONT * 
2 CONT
2 CONT Søsken:
2 CONT * Tøger Palleson Thrane 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Det kan ikke fastslås med 100 % sikkerhet, men det er sannsynlig at faren hans er Peder Christensen Trane, rådmann i Viborg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ektefelle: Kirsten Pallesdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn:
2 CONT * Christen Christenson Trane f.1533 d.12 jul.1600, Stavanger
2 CONT * Palle Christenson Trane f.1537 d.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ektefelle: Margrete Pedersd. f.1523 Danmark  Barn:
2 CONT * Else Christensdatter Trane f.1548 Viborg d.1600 Stavanger
2 CONT * Peder Christensen Trane f.1550 Viborg, Danmark d.1622
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde: http://old.genealogi.no/flip_books/trane/
2 CONT
2 CONT Kjøpmann og fogd i Viborg. 
2 CONT **************************************************
2 CONT
2 CONT A 1520s Christian Devotional in Danish - passed down generation to generation - by the descendents of Rev. Palle Trane - and transported by them to America when they emmigrated from Norway - is thought to have originated with Rev.
2 CONC  Palle Trane or - given the age - with his father, Christian Trane. It is currently in the county museum at Fergus Falls, Ottertail County, Minnesota.
