1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Google translate of the Norwegian entry:
2 CONT =============================
2 CONT Christen Jenssøn wife who had died 1574. Enlightenment that she would be daughter of Nils Jonsson (Pyrolysis of Gjersvik) and Adelus Kruckow, coming from H Sollied NST III and KS Kleppe NST XVI especially p. 25.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Tore Vigerust: "Debate about who the mother of Skak Lystrup was. <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> Christian Jenssøn wife who had died 1574. Enlightenment that she would be daughter Nils Jonsson (Pyrolysis of Gjersvik)
2 CONC  and Adelus Kruckow, coming from H Sollied NST III and KS Kleppe NST XVI especially p. 25.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Tore Vigerust: "Debate about who the mother of Skak Lystrup was.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is a source of "Lystrupætti" who says that her first name is Karen and she was the widow of Chess Nilsson Skjelbred when she married Christen. See copy of "Lystrupætti" under Sources.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Karen Nilsdatter, enken etter Schak Nilsen til Skilbred ved Skien
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Gift 1. gang med Christopher Andersen. (Død senest i begynnelsen av 1567.) (Norsk slektshistorisk tidsskrift. (NST). Bind 16. 1958: Nils Christensen paa Gjersviks ætt og etterslekt. s. 13.)
2 CONT Gift 2. gang før mars 1568 med Christen Jensen Kaupanger. (Norsk slektshistorisk tidsskrift. (NST). Bind 16. 1958: Nils Christensen paa Gjersviks ætt og etterslekt. s. 13.)
