1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Peder Ulfsson (Roos Af Ervalla) is the 2nd great grandson of [https://www.geni.com/path/H%C3%A5kon-V-Magnusson-King-of-Norway+is+related+to+Peder-Ulfsson?from=6000000000351087662&path_type=blood&to=6000000006151324
