2 CONC have been the daughter of Patrick Cheyne of Esslemont and Isobel Bade, the source being given as National Register of Archives Surveys - 0925, no. 273 and Register of the Great Seal iii.,3072. In Zetland Family Histories, she was 
2 CONC given as Margaret Cheyne, with no parentage mentioned.2,3 Family Patrick Cheyne b. c 1475, d. 1560 Children	 Margaret Cheyne+ b. c 1500 Thomas Cheyne 7th of Essilmont+ b. c 1515, d. a 1564 Jerome Cheyne+ b. c 1516, d. 1584 James C
