1 OCCU Riksråd, Häradshövding.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Johan Stensson Bese, till Herrsäter=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Sten Jönsson Bese and Kristina (Hatt)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/G%C3%A4dda Adelsvapen Geneologies Gädda]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 5'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Gädda (son of Nils Gädda Tab. 2 ). Knight, councilor and district chief. Married 1st to Katarina Eriksdotter, daughter of Erik Stensson ( Bielke ) and Birgitta Magnusdotter ( Porse ). Married 2nd to Elin, daughter of the Sca
2 CONC nian knight Axel Brade and Holgerd Holgersdotter (Krognos) . Married 3rd before 1441 to Katarina Bengtsdotter, daughter of Bengt Königsmark and Märta Tordsdotter ( Farmer ).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * (2) '''Anna Johandotter.''' Married to Gregers Mattsson (Lillie) in his first marriage.
2 CONT * (3) '''Kristina Johansdotter.''' Died before 1466. Married to Arvid Trolle .
2 CONT * '''Katarina Johansdotter.''' Married to Johan Stensson Bese in his first marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tillbakaseende_ulv Adelsvapen Tillbakaseende_ulv]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 18'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Knut Bengtsson (son of Bengt Gotskalksson, tab. 13). First appears in 1449 and was already a knight then. Got from the grandfather in 1451 Stävlö in Åby sn. Norra Möre hd, which became his seat. Still alive 14.4 1470 but was proba
2 CONC bly dead 5.8 1473. Married to Anna Gustavsdotter, who as a widow lived at Stävlö, died between 25.11 1482 and 16.2 1484 and was the daughter of the knight, councilor and lawman in Tiohärad Gustav Laurensson (Ängaätten), whose only
2 CONC  known wife was an unnamed daughter of the district chief Olof Haraldsson (Hjulstaätten).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Birgitta Knutsdotter.''' Still alive 28.6 1493. '''Married no later than 16.2 1484 to Riksrad Johan Bese , from whom she was divorced. His seat farm was Herrsäter in Värna sn, Bankekinds hd in Östergötland. On 17 August 1472,
2 CONC  he had given a gift of morning to Katarina Johansdotter (Pike), who died between 28 May 1475 and 15 February 1477.'He had then been married to Estrid Jönsdotter (Tre roros ).''' Johan Bese died in the storm of 1505.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Bengt Knutsson,''' 1484—1506. See tab. 19.
2 CONT * '''Gustav Knutsson.''' Lived 22.9 1484.
2 CONT
2 CONT
