2 CONC datter Ræder Sindalen/Ksedalen, Norway 1688  November 1688 Age 57 Burial of Christopher Sunndal, Møre og Romsdal, Norway 1696  8 November 1696 Age 65 Death of Christopher at Hov Sunndal, Møre og Romsdal, Norway ????  Birth of Sven
