1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 8788. Peder Pedersson STAUR-BOSERØD was born calculated 1470 in Denmark. He died in 1512 in Holmgaard.Sjelland.Denmark. Peder married Boel Henriksdatter BUNDEN-LILLESCHOFF. [Parents] 
