1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Nils [på] Bastøy (c. 1575 – 1627)'''==
2 CONT
2 CONT 🪵 '''Status''': Tenant/user (bruker) of the Bastøy farm in Borre. Mentioned in records from 1613 to 1619.
2 CONT 🚢 '''Occupation''': Sold timber at the harbor in Moss. Owned his own ship (kreier). Transported timber for the construction of Frederiksborg Castle.
2 CONT 👨‍👩‍👦 '''Family''': Son of Hans Bastøy and Guri Thorgeirsdatter. Husband of NN Madsdatter Åsgården. Father of '''Anne Nilsdatter''' and '''Mats Nilsen'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''':
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Primary Archival Sources''':
2 CONT # 1613 — SAO, Bailiff accounts (Fogderegnskap), Akershus len, Moss fogderi, 1/5 1612 - 1/5 1613, dated 30/4 1613.
2 CONT # 1616 — RA, RK, Bailiff accounts (Fogderegnskap), Akershus len, Moss fogderi, 1/5 1616 - 1/5 1617, dated 28. June 1617.
2 CONT # 1618 — RA, RK, Bailiff accounts (Fogderegnskap), Akershus len, Moss fogderi, 1/5 1618 - 1/5 1619, dated 23. May 1619.
2 CONT * '''Literature and websites''':
2 CONT # Gjallarhorn magazine, No. 57, 2015.
2 CONT # The website pettersen-dahl.no (section [https://pettersen-dahl.no/Borre/Gaarder/Bastoey.html Bastøy)].
2 CONT
