2 CONC an of 2000 spd, in 1859. In 1861 he transferred for 5500 spd. and livery to his son Jan Olsen Horn, he was born in 1821 and he died in 1913. Jan Olsen married Marte Hansdatter, she was born in 1824 and died in 1908. Jan Olsen and 
