1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A contributor here at Geni has claimed that Karen Henriksdatter Ås-Søndre/ Folevall was a daughter of "Henrik Hendriksen Fossum" and "Mette Thomesdatter". '''Is there any evidence for this claim?''' No persons with
2 CONC  these names are listed anywhere at Gjerpen at the time in [https://gamlegjerpen.no/index.htm "Gamle Gjerpen"].
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Marriage record I (26-12-1666):'''
2 CONT Skien kirkebøker, AV/SAKO-A-302/F/Fa/L0001: Kirkebok, 1659-1679, s. 28. https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061207010019
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Engagement record II (08-07-1668):'''
2 CONT Skien kirkebøker, AV/SAKO-A-302/F/Fa/L0001: Kirkebok, 1659-1679, s. 9. https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061207010004
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Burial record (30-09-1721; Karen is claimed to be 76 years old at death):'''
2 CONT Gjerpen kirkebøker, AV/SAKO-A-265/F/Fa/L0001: Kirkebok, 1681-1746, s. upaginert. https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040329
2 CONT ----
