1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Is there any evidence, whatsoever, that Rasmus Christensen Heisholt was a son of Lensmann Kristen Rasmussen Ås-Søndre/ Folevall and his wife Karen Henriksdatter Ås-Søndre/ Folevall?''' 
2 CONT '''This appears to be pure, unfounded, speculation.''' According to this Geni entry, Rasmus Christensen Heisholt was born about 1655. According to [https://tng.simt.no/getperson.php?personID=I5625&tree=SiMT "Slekt i midtre Telemar
2 CONC k"], however, he was born about 1660. At these times Kristen Rasmussen would have been about 16 and about 21 years old. Furthermore, Kristen Rasmussen and his wife Karen Henriksdatter were married after their engagement of 08-07-1
2 CONC 668. It is more than unlikely that they had a son 8 or 13 years before that date.
2 CONT Moreover, according to [https://gamleholla.no/Bygdebok/8_HeisholtOstre.htm "Gamle Holla"], Rasmus Christensen Heisholt was born about 1630, i.e. '''before''' the birth of Kristen Rasmussen Ås-Søndre/ Folevall.
2 CONT Neither [https://tng.simt.no/getperson.php?personID=I5625&tree=SiMT "Slekt i midtre Telemark"], nor [https://gamleholla.no/Bygdebok/8_HeisholtOstre.htm "Gamle Holla"] or [https://gamlegjerpen.no/Bygdebok/Furuvald/Furuvald.htm "Gam
2 CONC le Gjerpen"], make '''any''' suggestion indicating that Rasmus Christensen Heisholt was a son of Lensmann Kristen Rasmussen Ås-Søndre/ Folevall and his wife Karen Henriksdatter Ås-Søndre/ Folevall.
2 CONT ----
