1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Engagement record (07-04-1722; "Jørgen Christenss. og Maren Halvorsdatter fra Kleven, Caut: Peder Lænsmand og Hans Christenssøn"):''' As both of the two witnesses at the engagement were brothers of Jørgen Kriste
2 CONC nsen Folevall, it seems ''likely, although not definitively proven'', that this was the engagement record of the latter.
2 CONT Gjerpen kirkebøker, AV/SAKO-A-265/F/Fa/L0001: Kirkebok, 1681-1746, s. upaginert. https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040330
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage record (06-12-1722; "Jørgen Christenss. og Maren Halvorsdatter fra Kleven"):'''
2 CONT Gjerpen kirkebøker, AV/SAKO-A-265/F/Fa/L0001: Kirkebok, 1681-1746, s. upaginert. https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040330
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Burial record (05-09-1731; Jørgen Kristensen is claimed to be 55 years old at death, died from lightening strike):''' There is no ''direct'' evidence that the Jørgen Kristensen Kleiva that was buried 10-09-1731, thus born about
2 CONC  1676, is identical to Jørgen Kristensen Folevall, but it seems very likely.  
2 CONT Gjerpen kirkebøker, AV/SAKO-A-265/F/Fa/L0001: Kirkebok, 1681-1746, s. upaginert. https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040350
2 CONT ----
