2 CONT ----
2 CONT Jørgen Kristensen Folevall is listed as a godparent at 7 baptisms at Gjerpen between 1699 and 1719 (sometimes for the children of his siblings, and sometimes jointly with some of his siblings); namely on [https://goto.digitalarkiv
2 CONC et.no/kb20061206040275 29-05-1699], [https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040281 04-09-1701], [https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040312 15-07-1714], [https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040312 22-07-1714], [https:/
2 CONC /goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040312 29-09-1714], [https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040318 19-09-1717], and [https://goto.digitalarkivet.no/kb20061206040321 18-06-1719].
2 CONT ----
