2 CONT Levor Knudsen Riis fra Gulset(B) f. ca. 1638 bg. 18/11-1699. "Levor Ries, 61 ½ aar g.", s.a. Knud Levorsen Gulset fra Nærum. g1g m. Gunhild Mogensdatter fra Mo f. ca. 1643 bg. 13/12-1683. ”Levor Risis qvinde, Gunnil Monsd. 40 aar 
2 CONC g.”, d.a. Mons Helgesen Moe og Aase Simensdatter Meen, datterdatter av Simen Dyresen Meen. g2g 13/7-1684 m. Astri Ingebretsdatter fra Høgset f. ca. 1660 bg. 29/4-1714. "Astrij Riis fra Osebachen, 54 aar." Hun døde på Osebakken, tr
2 CONC olig boende hos sin datter Kirsten. Hun ble da kalt Astri Riis. Kirstens 1. barn som ble født like etter  at Astri døde, ble også døpt Astri som skikken var. 1. Maren Levorsdatter f. ca. 1664 g.m. Christen Hansen. Se Gravli(1). 2.
2 CONC  Anund Levorsen f. ca. 1666. Riis(8) og Langerød(B). 3. Lucas Levorsen f. ca. 1668 d. 1729. Skifte i Skien. Ugift. Han var fadder som ”Levor Riises søn Lucas” i 1697 for Christen Hansen Riises sønn Ole. 4. Anders Levorsen f. ca. 1
2 CONC 670 g1g Ellen Jensdatter bg. 2/7-1724. ”Anders Leworssøns qvinde paa Osb. 41 aar, 16 dage gl.” 
2 CONT     g2g 21/1-1725 i Eid. krk. ”Anders Lefworssøn og Margareth Olsdatter af Ossebachen. Confirmations Sedell fra Berthell Haggedam(?) i Scheen.” 
2 CONT     Forlovere: Nils Albretssøn og Anders Christopherssøn Osebakken. Fra ”Sjeleregisteret”, 1725 Eidanger: ”Bjørntvedt: Anders Ledvorsen gl. 54 år har 
2 CONT     tient som soldat nu frijkj. gift med Magrethe Olsdatter gl. 35 år deres to sønner Jens Anderssøn gl. 7 aar (dpt. 1718 i Eid.) og Iwer La........? Anderssøn 
2 CONT     gl. 8 aar og pigebørn Barbro Andersdatter gl. 23 aar tiener i Schien, Margarethe Andersdatter gl. 11 aar tiener i Gierpen Sogn, Ellj Andersdatter gl. 9 aar og 
2 CONT     Marj Andersdatter gl. 3 aar.” 5. Aase Levorsdatter f. ca. 1675 bg. 23/11-1696. "Levor Risis d. Aase 21 aar g." 6. Margrete Levorsdatter dpt. 29/10-1682 g.m. Jon Halvorsen Sanne. Se Sanni(A). Barn i 2. ektesk.  -   bg. 16/4-168
2 CONC 5. ”Levor Rises dødfødde barn.” -   bg. 17/5-1685. Barnet ble lagt i samme kiste som Ole Riising, 87 år gml. 7. Amun dpt. 9/5 -1686 bg. 13/5 -1686. ”Levor Rises søn Amun 10 dage g.” 8. Gunhild Levorsdatter dpt. 3/7-1687 g.m. Nils 
2 CONC Isaksen Gulseth. Bodde på Bratsbergkleiva. Se Familie 1 - Kleiva 1730. 9. Kirsten Levorsdatter dpt. 9/4-1690 g1g 10/10-1714 m. Vetle Hansen Søli. De bodde på Osebakken. Kirsten ble g2g m. Anders Christophersen. Se Åsterød(1). 10. 
2 CONC Maren dpt. 23/7-1693  bg. 4/2-1699. "Levor Rises datter Maren 5 ½ aar g." 11. Ingebret dpt. 11/10-1696 bg. 23/11-1696. "Levor Risis søn Ingebret 5 uger g." Gravlagt samme dag som sin halvsøster Aase. 12. Knud dpt. 7/8-1698 bg. 1/1
2 CONC 1 -1699. "Levor Rises søn Knut 1 aar g." Br. 1668.
2 CONT
2 CONT F.f. Levor Riises datter Kirsten: Nils Tofte, Tollef Søli, Ole Høiset, Sissel Sande, Wetler Tvetens q. Karen, Maren Anundsdatter tjener på Sande (Sanni). F.f. Levor Riises datter Maren: Halvor Aaltvet, Lars Li, Ole fra Høiset, Ses
2 CONC sel Sande, Gunhild Ouestad, Maren i tjeneste på Sande (Sanni). F.f. Levor Riises søn Ingebret: Gregorius Høiset. Christen Hansen Riis, Jens Klep, Nils Sandes q., Ole Høysets q., Maren Hansdatter fra Aaltved. F.f. Levor Riises sønn
2 CONC  Knud: Halvor Aaltved, Christen Riis, Solve Ouestads sønn Nils, Nils sandes q. Gunhild, Maren Hansdatter hos Halvor Aaltvet.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Levor Knudsen was born in Gulset, Gjerpen, Telemark, Norway, in 1638. He died in Riis søndre, Gjerpen, Telemark, Norway, on November 18, 1699, at the age of 61. He married twice, 1. Gunhild Mogensdatter and then he married 2. Astr
2 CONC i Ingebretsdatter.
2 CONT Levor and Gunhild had six children.
2 CONT Maren Levorsdatter was born in 1664 and she married Christen Hansen. They had nine children, Ole Christensen, Maren Christensdatter, Hans Christensen, Levor Christensen, Mathias Christensen, Tone Christensdatter, Gjertrud Christen
2 CONC sdatter, Jon Christensen and Gregorius Chistensen.
2 CONT Anund Levorsen was born in 1666. He lived at Riis and Langerød. He married Maren Amundsdatter. They had a daughter Gunhild Anundsdatter.
2 CONT Lucas Levorsen was born in 1668 and he died in 1729. He lived in Skien. He never married.
2 CONT Anders Levorsen was born in 1670, He married Ellen Jensdatter. The he married Magrethe Olsdatter when he was 54. He was a soldier at one time.
2 CONT Aase Levorsdatter was bor in 1675 and she died at the age of 21.
2 CONT Margrete Levorsdatter was born in 1682. She married Jon Halvorsen Sanne. Margrete was Jons first wife. He married a total of 5 times. Margaret died in childbirth with her stillborn child, she was 24.
2 CONT Then Levor married Astri Ingebretsdatter in 1684. They had six children.
2 CONT Amun Levorsen was born in 1686 and he died 10 days later.
2 CONT Gunhild Levorsdatter was born in 1687. She married Nils Isaksen Gulseth. They lived at Bratsbergkleiva. They had two children, Kirsten Nilsdatter born in 1724 and Else Nilsdatter born in 1726.
2 CONT Kirsten Levorsdatter was born in 1690. She married Vetle Hansen Søli. They lived on Osebakken. Then she married Anders Christophersen. She had one son with Vetle, his name was Vetle born in 1723 and he died at the age of 3. He dro
2 CONC wned in the Aaselven River. She had four children with Anders, Christopher Andersen, Ole Andersen, Gunhild Andersdatter and Vetle Andersen he died at 6 months.
2 CONT Maren Levorsdatter was born in 1693 and she died at the age of 5.
2 CONT Ingebret Levorsen was born in 1696 and he died at the age of 5 weeks.
2 CONT Knud Levorsen was born in 1698 and he died at the age of 1.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6/2/1700       LEDVOR KNUTSSØN RIIS          Bamble Shift prot. No. 2, p. 151a.
2 CONT Søndre Riis Heirs:
2 CONT Widow?
2 CONT Lidvard (Ledvor) had two children
2 CONT After the first marriage:
2 CONT 1. Anund Lidvardsson.
2 CONT 2. Lucas Lidvardsson.
2 CONT 3. Andres Lidvardsøn.
2 CONT Maren Lidvardsdtr. gm Christen Hansen.
2 CONT 5. Margrethe Lidvardsdtr.
2 CONT After 2nd marriage:
2 CONT 6. Gunhild Lidvardsdtr.
2 CONT 7. Kirsten Lidvardsdtr.
2 CONT As guardian for Margrethe was Niels Sande. Widow guardian of her children (nos. 6 and 7).
2 CONT Uncle Ole Høyset will supervise.
2 CONT
