2 CONT * The Ramstad family Born in Stäflö, Kalmar county on the Anlade Kjervinge estate, the Stärk and Ramstad families . Holmfrid Pedersdotter Pik was the sister of Margareta Persdotter ("Mrs. Marette to Dyngevik") who owned the Dingel
2 CONC vik homestead in Steneby. It had 12 salvation homes under it. Dingelvik was then inherited by the Svinhuvud family and still exists as a stud farm. (Dalsland).
2 CONT * Arrived at 1590 Kirvinge (?) Sowing. (Source: G Elgenstierna)
