2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1  [Unknown] Alvsdatter,   b. Abt 1346, of, Trosset, Fåberg, Oppland, Norway ,  Married  Abt 1370  of, Fåberg, Oppland, Norway    Children    1. Arnbjörn Sunnulfsson,   b. Abt 1372, Hovin, Fåberg, Oppland, Norway ,   d. Abt
2 CONC  1432, of, , , Norway  
