1 NOTE Bente Rasmusdatter Muus  was born about 1600 in either on Fyn, Denmark or in Ringsaker, Hedmark, Norway. She died in 1673 in Roskilde, Sjælland, Denmark. She was buried on 16 Jul 1673 in Roskilde, Sjæ>
