1 CONT Rasmus Christensen's first three children were born at Venstøb.  Th e
1 CONT remaining children, born after the death of Rasmus' father Christen
1 CONT Rasmu ssen, were born at Forevall.  Rasmus' brother Peder Christensen
1 CONT Bertberg was lensmann for Gjerpen parish from 1712-1743, and Peder's
1 CONT decendants continued in the post of lensmann for several generations.
1 CONT Rasmus Faarevall, 59 aar on M ay 24 1730.  Probate, Skifte, Bamble book
1 CONT 3a, page 323, Feb 1, 1731.  Widow i s Maren Truelsdatter with 11 children:
1 CONT Halvor, Mads 24, Christen 19, Peder 16 , Henrich 12, Morten 8, Frantz 5.
1 CONT Daughters, Anne Maria 28, Anne 26, Dorthe 17, and Karen 14.  There are 3
1 CONT brothers listed, Hans Christensen, Peder Chris tensen, lensmannen, and
1 CONT Morten Christensen Boe.  Guardian for the widow is he r brother Peder
1 CONT Truelssen.
